stateDiagram-v2
    %% UI_Screen_Matrix_simplified.mmd
    title Client Routes — Auth-Gated States

    [*] --> Loading

    Loading --> LoginScreen : handshake → anon
    LoginScreen --> Authed : sign-in success
    Authed --> NotAuthorized : [Authorize] + anon
    Authed --> NotFound : bad path
    Authed --> LoggedOut : sign-out
    LoggedOut --> LoginScreen

    state Authed {
        [*] --> Solo
        Solo --> Lobby : tap Play Online
        Lobby --> Race : host StartGame
    }
